@FinCore.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5157
@portfolioId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@instrumentId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@tradeId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333

# After creating a portfolio and instrument, replace the sample IDs above with
# their returned IDs before sending the nested trade and price requests.

### API discovery
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Value a stock position
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pricing/stock?symbol=msft&unitPrice=12.50&quantity=4
Accept: application/json

###

### Negative price is rejected
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pricing/stock?symbol=MSFT&unitPrice=-12.50&quantity=4
Accept: application/json

###

### Missing symbol is rejected
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pricing/stock?unitPrice=12.50&quantity=4
Accept: application/json

###

### Zero quantity is rejected
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pricing/stock?symbol=MSFT&unitPrice=12.50&quantity=0
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a USD portfolio
POST {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Synthetic Growth Portfolio",
  "baseCurrency": "USD"
}

###

### List portfolios
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolios
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a portfolio
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get trade-derived positions
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}/positions
Accept: application/json

###

### Value a portfolio at a historical UTC cutoff
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}/valuation?asOfUtc=2026-11-16T15%3A30%3A00Z
Accept: application/json

###

### Value a portfolio using the current UTC cutoff
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}/valuation
Accept: application/json

###

### Register a USD equity (symbols are normalized to uppercase)
POST {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instruments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "msft",
  "name": "Synthetic Example Equity",
  "currency": "USD"
}

###

### Record a BUY with a stable caller-supplied tradeId
POST {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "{{tradeId}}",
  "instrumentId": "{{instrumentId}}",
  "side": "Buy",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unitPrice": 25.50,
  "executedAt": "2026-11-16T15:00:00Z"
}

###

### Record a simulated USD market price
POST {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instruments/{{instrumentId}}/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 25.75,
  "currency": "USD",
  "asOfUtc": "2026-11-16T15:00:00Z"
}

###

### Get the latest eligible market price at a UTC cutoff
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instruments/{{instrumentId}}/prices/latest?asOfUtc=2026-11-16T15%3A30%3A00Z
Accept: application/json
